## Context

`query_direct.py` (and all other query scripts) used `--models` to accept
the model registry path, which was ambiguous. Renamed to `--models-registry`
across all six query scripts and their tests.

`experiment1.mk` did not exist. Exp 1 was run by hand via CLI. Now that
Exp 1 and Exp 2 Arm 1 share `protocol_07_naive_prompt.md`, a Makefile
target documents and reproduces the run.

## Exit criteria
- [x] `--models-registry` accepted; `--models` removed from all six query scripts
- [x] All tests pass (`make check-fast`)
- [x] `experiments/experiment1.mk` exists with correct target
